     1833           f-prih
     1834           f-rash
     1835           f-vzvr
     1836           f-vzvr-post
     1837           f-discnt
     1838           with FRAME ZAPAS .
     1839           DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     1840           end procedure.
